@baseUrl = http://localhost:5187
@catalogApiKey = replace-with-catalog-api-key-not-sonovault-key
@recordingId = replace-with-canonical-recording-id

### Explicit read-only lookup; the server supplies the SonoVault key
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/recordings/{{recordingId}}/enrichment/sonovault
Authorization: Bearer {{catalogApiKey}}

### Missing Recording returns 404 without calling SonoVault
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/recordings/not-an-existing-recording/enrichment/sonovault
Authorization: Bearer {{catalogApiKey}}
